      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780114709610,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In Java, a Collection is a framework used to store, manage, and manipulate \ngroups of objects dynamically.\n\n> Dynamic memory\n> Ready-made data structures\n> Utility methods\n> Fast operations\n> Better data handling\n\ncollection is a Type of pre-defined Data Structure \nin java",
      "fontSize": 34.85712890625,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In Java, a Collection is a framework used to store, manage, and manipulate \ngroups of objects dynamically.\n\n> Dynamic memory\n> Ready-made data structures\n> Utility methods\n> Fast operations\n> Better data handling\n\ncollection is a Type of pre-defined Data Structure \nin java",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
